<!-- Phone settings (Connect IQ app / Garmin Express), variant resources-settings-climb: with climbing.
     There are two variants (climb, noclimb); keep both identical except the KindClimbH list entry, value 10.
     monkey.jungle assigns them to the devices by resourcePath. They appear only for store and beta installs,
     not for a sideloaded .prg. Same entries and order as the on-device menu (source/settings/SettingsMenu.mc);
     the list values are the ColorChoice and DataKind values. -->
